  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 806.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 806.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to hazardous waste fuels, as defined in Env-Hw 801.02(a), that are burned for energy recovery in any boiler or industrial furnace that is not regulated under Env-Hw 707 or Env-Hw 708.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12350, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14526, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
